# Issue #35: keys for Doom's title and menus (doomkeys.session). Escape opens the menu, Q is not
# given to Doom and must change nothing, Down then Enter picks Options, Escape backs out.
frame 10 down ESCAPE
frame 11 up ESCAPE
frame 18 down Q
frame 19 up Q
frame 25 down DOWN
frame 26 up DOWN
frame 30 down ENTER
frame 31 up ENTER
frame 45 down ESCAPE
frame 46 up ESCAPE
